ection-api-\nbreadth, v2-split-asset-read, v2-string-decrypt-name-resolve, webview-asset-js-scan, whitebox-table-cipher-eval,\nxamarin-xalz-blob-unpack, zip-slip-entry-normalize, zip-structure-anomaly-scan.\n\nForecast after D30 (D31 = the LAST day): D28-D30 each shipped a NEW v1 codec that is a small STACK of known steps\n(`packet` hex+frame+XOR8, `table` hex+`b-(key+3i)`, `layered` base64+`b^(key+i)`+reverse) and a v2 TT gate that encodes\nthe same idea; prompts list far more than ships (D30: \"obfuscation, native indirection, runtime decryption, integrity\nchecks\" -> one peel fn). D30's race probe was SILENT on `layered` (LLM 40 s): a generic stacked-codec search is the top\ngap. For the finale expect (a) a v1 codec stacking 3-4 steps or declaring `layers`/`steps`, possibly any older codec;\n(b) a v2 chain that finally COMPOSES old mechanics in one build (JNI hop + decrypt loop + reflection + split read +\nCRC/digest \"integrity\"); (c) a 15-set Mastery from any day in either schema (d12, d20, d27 never yet v2). Words that have\nnever turned real and could on a capstone: d28 multi-frame seq/nonce, d27 bundled-lib reachability, d29 AES T-boxes.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"id\": \"v1-composed-codec-search\", \"concept\": \"composed / stacked v1 codec: 2-4 known steps under one unknown codec name and one int `key` (row 118, row 70)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D30 `layered` = base64 -> b ^ ((key+i)&255) -> reverse; D29 `table` = hex -> (b - (key+3i)) & 255; the D30 race probe was silent (each step exists in lib.android, the STACK did not). Add `lib.android.stacked_codec_search(puzzle)`: unwrap {hex, base64 (std/urlsafe, padding-tolerant), base32, base85/a85, none}; then try keystream ops {xor, sub, add} with streams key+c*i (c in -7..7), key^i,\n  {\"id\": \"v1-declared-layers-pipeline\", \"concept\": \"puzzle JSON that DECLARES its pipeline (`layers`/`steps`/`pipeline`/`chain` list, per-step keys, nested puzzle JSON inside decoded data)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"Finale form of D30: {\\\"codec\\\":\\\"layered\\\",\\\"layers\\\":[\\\"base64\\\",{\\\"xor\\\":12,\\\"step\\\":1},\\\"reverse\\\"]} or keys key/key2/iv/step/offset, or a decoded payload that is itself a huntress puzzle JSON (onion). Implement a step registry reusing every v1 codec seen d1-d30 (plain, reverse, base64, hex, xor, caesar, split+order, indexed, packet, table, layered, dynami\n  {\"id\": \"v2-composed-mechanics-chain\", \"concept\": \"one v2 build composing several old mechanics in sequence (row 119)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D30 prompt promised native indirection + runtime decryption + integrity checks; the TT shipped only peelStack. A capstone build may chain: JNI nativeShare(long[,int]) (d15/d16) -> decryptByte loop over a byte[] (d18) -> Class.forName(decrypted name).getDeclaredMethod(\\\"m\\\"+dispatch(k)).invoke (d19) -> readSplit/getAssets bytes (d26) -> CRC32/MessageDigest over own asset/dex bytes (d25) -> state-machine walk (d28) -> table walk \n  {\"id\": \"v2-checksum-intrinsics-crc32-adler\", \"concept\": \"'integrity checks' made real in the v2 chain: java.util.zip.CRC32/Adler32/Checksum, MessageDigest over the APK's own bytes (asset, classes.dex, signing cert)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"Evaluator intrinsics: CRC32()/Adler32() update(int)/update(byte[],off,len)/getValue (unsigned 32-bit in a long), MessageDigest SHA-1/SHA-256/MD5 digest() -> byte[] then folded big-endian, Arrays.hashCode/String.hashCode, ByteBuffer.wrap(..).getLong/order(LITTLE_ENDIAN); byte sources: getAssets().open(name) / ZipFile entries of the \n  {\"id\": \"v1-codec-registry-all-days-regression\", \"concept\": \"finale single may reuse ANY v1 codec of d1-d30 (or a stack of them)\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"Make one table-driven regression over every v1 codec shape seen (plain, reverse, base64, hex, xor b64+key, caesar 